  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NLRC media mission KRC and SRCS June 2023- - Iris van Enthoven</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Netherlands Red Cross wants to create awareness in The Netherlands about the impact of climate 
change (as for example the ongoing drought and hunger in the Horn of Africa) and also to show the 
hope and solutions such as the nature based ones and the role of the Red Cross, the PNS, HNS and 
wider Movement Partners in this.</narrative>
  </description>
